omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ocSG0sCre4AQ7kNvwH5WEe0&_nc_oc=AdqY7D7Og7iALKW-Pt9rPKetsc3f3m722HAFQmStd2heKZt55UujQJ31Wo9yQexJOck&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGrA5XeFj-k0vj-Ri4qgH2NKU_zyn0Zx4AuiTamf9R9NQ&oe=6A898674"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=19bYKksAUTcQ7kNvwEMU_A-&_nc_oc=AdrD03qI3sXy__vWk35IakMUxMFfA2efs5oY-8pCcscmDldruWbXlsXIjZ67l5P-Q6Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFQ9XWQzzrDgO9SIm9C6Te7ty6ar7Ppz4j9_l0Xck148w&oe=6A8987D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G1KrcMB-plwQ7kNvwG9BXPM&_nc_oc=AdpwZsDnVg4wxJSlS1Rwqb81SxKFt0kzQNWhGPh7bH-M2-1s9rw1_52pVR2Dti0kmpw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHR3R1a9G3bsiH08Cnr5UpXxe8HUX4XXFZABUeTo3QjRA&oe=6A899CF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://